WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:03.670
You failed to protect your country.

00:03.670 --> 00:06.270
You have lost the right to be king.

00:06.270 --> 00:12.230
I shall protect true Absolute Justice,
along with our savior Noah.

00:13.410 --> 00:17.710
You misunderstood the meaning of the savior!

00:24.820 --> 00:28.280
I've brought Hyrum to you, just like you asked!

00:41.640 --> 00:49.240
Far away from the town where I was born

00:49.240 --> 00:52.410
I am singing

00:52.410 --> 01:00.060
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:00.060 --> 01:03.320
Away in my pocket

01:03.320 --> 01:08.860
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:08.860 --> 01:13.900
Toward the unknown road

01:13.900 --> 01:19.340
I'll walk

01:19.340 --> 01:24.750
I'll move forward

01:24.750 --> 01:29.580
Not for someone else's sake

01:29.580 --> 01:35.060
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:35.060 --> 01:40.530
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:40.530 --> 01:45.770
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:45.770 --> 01:49.790
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:51.440 --> 01:54.970
I live

02:03.350 --> 02:06.980
Episode 39
Epiphany

02:14.900 --> 02:17.830
I did what you said.

02:17.830 --> 02:20.740
Hurry up and release the hostages.

02:20.740 --> 02:23.200
And then this war is over!

02:24.110 --> 02:26.270
That's what you want, eh?

02:26.270 --> 02:29.070
Yeah, but that's not all.

02:29.740 --> 02:31.540
You see...

02:39.250 --> 02:41.550
You, I just can't forgive.

02:44.860 --> 02:45.230
King Hugh!

02:45.230 --> 02:45.730
King Hugh!
King Hugh!

02:45.730 --> 02:47.020
King Hugh!

03:00.780 --> 03:02.400
What?!

03:15.460 --> 03:17.830
Underestimated me, didn't you, boy?

03:17.830 --> 03:21.450
I knew what was going on in
your little mind all along.

03:22.630 --> 03:26.000
But thanks for bringing Hyrum to me.

03:26.000 --> 03:28.100
I'll give you a reward later,

03:28.100 --> 03:30.230
a nice, big one.

03:34.110 --> 03:36.240
What should we do, Kira?

03:41.580 --> 03:43.720
Noah? Noah?!

03:43.720 --> 03:46.020
Open your eyes, Noah.

03:48.860 --> 03:51.650
L..Lady Diana...

03:52.760 --> 03:54.400
Thank goodness.

03:54.400 --> 03:57.430
I'm sorry things have turned out this way.

03:57.430 --> 04:02.230
But please understand: this was all
for the sake of Absolute Law.

04:03.240 --> 04:07.370
Even handing Holy Father Hyrum
over to the enemy?

04:09.310 --> 04:14.550
Hyrum can no longer fulfill the role of Holy Father.

04:14.550 --> 04:17.550
His Absolute Law has died.

04:17.550 --> 04:19.320
But...

04:19.320 --> 04:22.560
Let us escape this land, together.

04:22.560 --> 04:27.160
And then, we will create a new nation
of Absolute Law.

04:27.160 --> 04:30.670
I can't do something like that.

04:30.670 --> 04:34.120
I know you can, you are the savior.

04:46.880 --> 04:51.510
Khan, at this point we don't have time to wait
for the Council to make a resolution!

04:53.820 --> 04:56.720
I'll take full responsibility!

04:56.720 --> 04:59.520
So, let's send reinforcements ourselves!

05:00.060 --> 05:01.860
Khan!

05:09.870 --> 05:11.500
Zed...

05:13.210 --> 05:16.610
It would be easy to kill you.

05:16.610 --> 05:19.310
If I did that, everything would be over.

05:19.310 --> 05:21.580
But that would be boring!

05:21.580 --> 05:24.710
I want to have more fun!

05:31.490 --> 05:33.290
Your Holiness...

05:37.470 --> 05:40.260
You kill these two.

05:42.670 --> 05:48.440
You've maintained all this time that
you are Absolute Law itself.

05:48.440 --> 05:50.680
It should be easy for you to take their lives,

05:50.680 --> 05:54.810
if it's for the sake of Absolute Law.

05:56.350 --> 06:00.920
As long as you keep killing hostages,
I won't kill you.

06:00.920 --> 06:03.660
You'll be able to live for a while!

06:03.660 --> 06:08.460
After all, there are still plenty of hostages left!

06:14.200 --> 06:15.830
Damn it!

06:31.290 --> 06:32.550
What's wrong?

06:32.550 --> 06:34.120
Hurry it up!

06:34.120 --> 06:38.730
Holy Father, we became hostages of
the enemy and drove Neotopia...

06:38.730 --> 06:42.230
No, drove Your Holiness into
this terrible position.

06:42.230 --> 06:44.900
That was a violation of Absolute Law.

06:44.900 --> 06:50.030
Please, punish us in accordance
with Absolute Law!

07:07.460 --> 07:09.080
Holy Father!

07:09.490 --> 07:11.120
Hyrum...

07:17.000 --> 07:22.740
To think he wasted my mercy in letting
him maintain his principles...

07:22.740 --> 07:25.010
Absolute Law is brought down!

07:25.010 --> 07:28.310
Look what Neotopia's king has come to!

07:29.710 --> 07:31.680
Hear me, pitiful man...

07:31.680 --> 07:33.110
What?

07:33.110 --> 07:39.920
You have so much power as the king of Zymot,

07:40.960 --> 07:45.090
yet you cannot gain anything!

07:46.090 --> 07:50.830
Even if I die, Absolute Law is alive

07:50.830 --> 07:54.270
in the hearts of my people.

07:54.270 --> 07:57.400
It will never perish!

07:58.070 --> 07:59.670
You bastard...

07:59.670 --> 08:01.970
How dare you?!

08:12.550 --> 08:14.090
That's ...

08:14.090 --> 08:16.060
They're finally here!

08:17.060 --> 08:20.360
You see, Khan and Sebastian just
wouldn't leave me alone.

08:21.100 --> 08:22.720
Robès!

08:30.300 --> 08:31.940
The Templar Army?

08:31.940 --> 08:33.740
Those interfering pests!

08:51.130 --> 08:53.590
Please, hang in there, Your Holiness!

08:58.870 --> 09:00.600
Thanks, Robès.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.570
You're welcome.

09:08.380 --> 09:11.350
Please, take care of His Holiness!

09:13.080 --> 09:15.650
Don't bother, it will do no good.

09:15.650 --> 09:17.180
Don't get discouraged!

09:17.180 --> 09:18.820
Just a little more...

09:18.820 --> 09:22.160
No, I can tell...

09:22.160 --> 09:25.280
My life will end here.

09:25.890 --> 09:27.690
No!

09:29.160 --> 09:34.290
Zico, would you grant me a favor before I go?

09:35.300 --> 09:37.570
After I die,

09:37.570 --> 09:43.030
I want you to bear witness to what becomes
of this country's Absolute Justice!

09:46.210 --> 09:53.680
What I'm concerned about is Noah...

09:56.360 --> 09:58.150
Holy Father Hyrum!

10:11.770 --> 10:13.570
Wh..What is this?

10:18.580 --> 10:20.380
It couldn't be...

10:31.230 --> 10:33.190
Who's there?!

10:52.010 --> 10:53.550
Dodge her, Belladonna!

10:53.550 --> 10:55.670
Don't try to take her on!

10:58.990 --> 11:02.110
So, you're the commander?!

11:03.420 --> 11:04.590
Good question.

11:04.590 --> 11:06.260
You sure you haven't got the wrong guy?

11:06.260 --> 11:10.390
Whatever, I'll just kill you all!

11:13.170 --> 11:14.600
Who are you?

11:14.600 --> 11:16.900
What are you doing there?

11:19.640 --> 11:21.280
That's ...

11:21.280 --> 11:23.400
Monadi's spirit shard!

11:23.780 --> 11:25.080
Do you know what you're doing?

11:25.080 --> 11:28.210
That isn't something you should have!

11:31.650 --> 11:33.350
If that's how you want to be...

11:33.350 --> 11:34.980
Funam!

12:10.760 --> 12:15.700
Those who bare their fangs at me
will see my fangs in return!

12:15.700 --> 12:19.300
I don't really think I've bared my fangs at you.

12:19.300 --> 12:21.930
But wow, I certainly can't say I like your face.

12:23.740 --> 12:25.540
I'll kill you!

12:26.010 --> 12:27.630
Zed...

12:29.580 --> 12:35.210
Hugh, you alone I can never forgive!

12:43.490 --> 12:45.120
Die!

12:49.930 --> 12:51.560
Robès!

12:54.840 --> 12:57.460
You're next, boy.

12:58.040 --> 12:59.840
Why, you...

13:01.940 --> 13:03.570
Amir Gaul!

13:31.040 --> 13:32.840
Amir Gaul...

13:34.480 --> 13:37.100
This is Amir Gaul?

13:38.550 --> 13:40.340
Damn it!

13:49.390 --> 13:52.020
She can wield key spirits?!

13:57.460 --> 13:59.430
Noah, come with me.

13:59.430 --> 14:01.060
Funam!

14:14.680 --> 14:16.650
I won't let you get away.

14:34.840 --> 14:36.460
Noah!

14:37.370 --> 14:39.000
Noah!

14:46.410 --> 14:48.040
Funam...

14:53.390 --> 14:55.860
Noah! Noah!

14:56.420 --> 14:59.160
Noah! Noah!

14:59.160 --> 15:01.790
Where are you, Noah?!

15:02.460 --> 15:04.090
Sagiri!

15:04.470 --> 15:07.570
Sagiri, no! Run away!

15:07.570 --> 15:09.200
Noah...

15:32.360 --> 15:34.160
Is Hugh...

15:37.600 --> 15:38.700
Stop it!

15:38.700 --> 15:40.330
Let go of Sagiri!

15:40.330 --> 15:43.630
If you want her, hand over your key spirit.

15:45.170 --> 15:47.310
No doubt about it.

15:47.310 --> 15:49.140
I recognize you.

15:49.140 --> 15:52.440
You're Zed's mother, aren't you?

15:54.750 --> 15:56.620
Why would you...

15:56.620 --> 15:58.920
Hurry up and hand over your key spirit!

15:58.920 --> 16:00.650
Don't do it, Noah.

16:00.650 --> 16:02.520
Lady Diana...

16:02.520 --> 16:05.260
That key spirit, Sachura,

16:05.260 --> 16:09.800
is absolutely necessary for you
to be the true savior.

16:09.800 --> 16:13.370
In order to protect it, sacrifices must be made.

16:13.370 --> 16:14.640
But...

16:14.640 --> 16:16.930
You're telling me to let Sagiri die?!

16:18.240 --> 16:21.540
This is Absolute Law, Noah!

16:33.620 --> 16:35.250
Lady Diana!

16:37.090 --> 16:38.160
Noah!

16:38.160 --> 16:39.790
Sagiri!

16:40.530 --> 16:43.500
Noah!

16:46.300 --> 16:48.770
Sagiri!

17:25.670 --> 17:28.240
I'm going to get everything.

17:28.240 --> 17:31.870
And then I'll destroy it all with my own hands!

17:32.710 --> 17:35.020
What the hell are you talking about?

17:35.020 --> 17:40.320
I'll tear you to pieces, you and Amir Gaul both!

17:41.060 --> 17:42.490
Shut up.

17:42.490 --> 17:43.490
What?

17:43.490 --> 17:45.960
I said, shut up!

17:48.160 --> 17:53.620
I'll put an end to this meaningless fight
where nothing's left behind!

17:55.070 --> 17:57.400
Everything belongs to me!

17:57.400 --> 17:59.810
This country, the people's lives...

17:59.810 --> 18:01.080
It's all mine!

18:01.080 --> 18:02.080
I'm going to end it!
It's all mine!

18:02.080 --> 18:04.040
I'm going to end it!

18:40.880 --> 18:44.180
Die!

19:04.270 --> 19:07.240
Th..This can't be happening...

19:07.840 --> 19:09.810
Not to me...

19:18.450 --> 19:20.390
Pronimo disappeared?!

19:20.390 --> 19:22.180
It couldn't be!

20:08.600 --> 20:12.170
That is Amir Gaul's true form.

20:12.170 --> 20:14.110
Zed!

20:14.110 --> 20:15.900
Zed!

20:18.650 --> 20:20.940
Zed!

20:23.480 --> 20:28.920
In the end, I couldn't save anyone at all.

20:28.920 --> 20:30.990
Not Holy Father Hyrum,

20:30.990 --> 20:33.060
or Lady Diana,

20:33.060 --> 20:35.460
or the hostages...

20:35.460 --> 20:37.260
Or Sagiri...

20:57.680 --> 21:00.590
Zed! Are you okay?

21:00.590 --> 21:02.960
Roya and the old man...

21:02.960 --> 21:05.430
Robès! So, you're alive?

21:05.430 --> 21:08.700
Can you even imagine me dying?

21:08.700 --> 21:10.490
What about the hostages?!

21:11.330 --> 21:15.200
When Hugh went down,
the enemy lost the will to keep fighting,

21:15.200 --> 21:18.330
and the hostages were released safely too.

21:20.570 --> 21:22.810
So, everything's over.

21:22.810 --> 21:24.140
Yes...

21:24.140 --> 21:25.940
I see...

21:33.390 --> 21:35.090
Look!

21:35.090 --> 21:36.890
The Stupa!

21:40.360 --> 21:41.990
Noah!

21:42.400 --> 21:44.020
Noah!

22:00.680 --> 22:02.720
Where did Noah go?

22:02.720 --> 22:04.220
I don't know.

22:04.220 --> 22:08.350
I haven't seen him, Diana or
Sagiri since we split up.

22:09.120 --> 22:10.750
Noah...

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.520 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Sought-After Power

24:18.190 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Sought-After Power"
